      "title": "The Duke Returns From Death",
      "start_block": "B003",
      "end_block": "B023",
      "hook": "A trembling nobleman gasps 'Who are you?' as a scarred man in ducal regalia strides through smoke and rubble, answering coldly: 'You already know.'",
      "cliffhanger": "Rupert screams in denial 'You cannot be him. Alexander died!' and Alexander answers 'And yet, here I stand. That is the lie you built your life upon.'",
      "why": "Opens on a shocking identity reveal, builds through the guards' defiance, and cuts on the usurper's world collapsing before any resolution.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger won't know why Alexander was presumed dead or what Rupert stole, but the power dynamic is instantly clear."
    },
    {
      "title": "Mother Proclaims the Rightful Duke",
      "start_block": "B024",
      "end_block": "B037",
      "hook": "An elderly woman steps into the aisle with trembling outstretched hands, choking out 'Alexander...' as the scarred duke halts his march.",
      "cliffhanger": "Alexander's hand rests on his sabre hilt as he vows grimly: 'And now, Rupert... we settle what you stole.'",
      "why": "Emotional recognition scene pivots to a public proclamation and ends on a direct threat of vengeance, leaving the confrontation unresolved.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger won't know the mother was poisoned or why the title was stolen, but the emotional stakes and threat are self-evident."
    },
    {
      "title": "Guards Defy the Usurper",
      "start_block": "B009",
      "end_block": "B023",
      "hook": "Rupert furiously points and screams 'Guards! Arrest this imposter!' as the royal guardsman stands rigidly with his hand on his sabre.",
      "cliffhanger": "Rupert screams in denial 'You cannot be him. Alexander died!' and Alexander answers 'And yet, here I stand. That is the lie you built your life upon.'",
      "why": "Starts on a hysterical command, pivots on the guards' reverent defiance, and cuts on the usurper's denial being shattered.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger won't know the guards' history with Alexander, but their refusal to obey the screaming nobleman is instantly gripping."
    }
  ],
